OL,3,GNEWSAAutism and ADHD costs surge amid
OL,4,Aincreased demand
OL,5,
OL,6,FNHS spending on autism and ADHD
OL,7,Fservices in Kent has risen from
OL,8,F#640,000 to almost #29m in two years,
OL,9,Fand costs could reach #46m this year.
OL,11,FFigures presented to NHS Kent and
OL,12,FMedway's Integrated Care Board (ICB) in
OL,13,FSeptember showed spending on assessment
OL,14,Fand treatment rose from #640,000 in
OL,15,F2023-24 to #28.91m in 2025-26.
OL,17,FThe most likely forecast for 2026-27
OL,18,Fwas #32.1m, while a worst-case scenario
OL,19,Fcould see spending reach about #46m.
OL,20,FThe board heard #20m had been allocated
OL,21,Ffor the current financial year.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
