OL,3,GNEWSAAutism and ADHD costs surge amid
OL,4,Aincreased demand
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe ICB said the increase had been
OL,7,Fdriven by "a significant and sustained
OL,8,Frise in demand" and it planned to
OL,9,Fintroduce a new approach to
OL,10,Fcommissioning services in 2027.
